{"file": "逆江湖之苍生为局-第157集.mp4", "ep": 157, "duration": 54.7, "segments": [{"start": 6.22, "end": 8.02, "text": "白京城那边敌人太多了"}, {"start": 8.54, "end": 9.42, "text": "有他们在"}, {"start": 10.25, "end": 11.45, "text": "我放不开手脚"}, {"start": 11.81, "end": 12.45, "text": "英雄"}, {"start": 12.85, "end": 14.69, "text": "要不要和我去人多的地方"}, {"start": 14.69, "end": 21.77, "text": "你不怕死了"}, {"start": 22.13, "end": 24.77, "text": "照着我吗"}, {"start": 25.55, "end": 26.03, "text": "好"}, {"start": 26.43, "end": 27.39, "text": "那咱们一起去"}, {"start": 28.06, "end": 28.5, "text": "对了"}, {"start": 28.86, "end": 30.1, "text": "该给你起个名字了"}, {"start": 30.54, "end": 31.46, "text": "就叫"}, {"start": 32.61, "end": 33.57, "text": "辽园吧"}, {"start": 34.29, "end": 36.66, "text": "此去"}, {"start": 37.26, "end": 38.5, "text": "我定要把白京城"}, {"start": 38.7, "end": 40.93, "text": "留个天翻地覆"}, {"start": 41.25, "end": 49.43, "text": "残火辽园"}, {"start": 50.1, "end": 51.5, "text": "未曾令我熄灭"}, {"start": 52.2, "end": 54.16, "text": "我来江之化为灰烬"}]}